/P 85 0 R
/T (Was there a specific varnam passage that felt like a breakthrough moment for you? How did it change your perspective on your training? The chittaswaram in the varnam was my greatest challenge, technically demanding and mentally exhausting to master. But pushing through it, showed me something I now carry into every aspect of my training: focused determination is the difference between a passage that defeats you and one that defines you)
/E (Was there a specific varnam passage that felt like a breakthrough moment for you? How did it change your perspective on your training? The chittaswaram in the varnam was my greatest challenge, technically demanding and mentally exhausting to master. But pushing through it, showed me something I now carry into every aspect of my training: focused determination is the difference between a passage that defeats you and one that defines you)
