/Title (How does working in a group/thematic setting change your energy compared to a solo performance? When I dance by myself, I try to step beyond my own perspective and embody different emotions and characters. In a solo performance, I am responsible for shaping the entire journey, while in a group, the dynamics emerge naturally through shared movement, storytelling, and collaboration. The energy, nritta, and nritya are shared among the dancers, creating a collective experience.)
