443 0 obj
<<
/Title (What is the most profound piece of advice or wisdom your Guru has shared with you that you will carry forward long after your debut?  One valuable lesson I have learned from my guru and parents throughout this journey is to persevere, especially when the process becomes difficult. This is something that I can carry with me throughout my life and use it as a lesson to endure through all the highs and lows in life in order to achieve a tangible output.)
/Dest [9 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 394 0 R
/Next 486 0 R
>>
endobj
444 0 obj
<<
/Title (How has your relationship with Bharatanatyam evolved since your very first class? I have to admit, my first few classes, I was scared that I will not be able to succeed in Bharatanatyam. Over time, my relationship with the art form has grown much deeper, and I have grown more confident. It has become not just a dance style, but my source of happiness.)
/Dest [9 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 394 0 R
/Prev 487 0 R
>>
endobj
