486 0 obj
<<
/Title (What is one personal goal you are aiming to achieve by completing this journey? One way completing my arangetram serves as a stepping stone in my dance journey is towards facing my stage fright. Performing multiple pieces for an extended period of time, pushed me to improve my stamina and discipline and in doing so, shaped me into a more confident dancer and person.)
/Dest [9 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 394 0 R
/Prev 443 0 R
/Next 487 0 R
>>
